WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.079
Week 17: Preterite: Completed Events. report what happened sequence completed actions ask follow-up questions

2
00:00:08.079 --> 00:00:30.273
Read for the situation. Ayer un apagón afectó el barrio. Primero los vecinos llamaron a la compañía eléctrica. Luego organizaron luces y comida para las personas mayores. Yesterday a power outage affected the neighborhood. First the neighbors called the electric company. Then they organized lights and food for the older residents.

3
00:00:30.273 --> 00:00:39.035
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:39.035 --> 00:00:44.747
Reading activities. Reading activity 40; Reading activity 41

5
00:00:44.747 --> 00:00:52.741
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:52.741 --> 00:01:22.689
Model language. Ayer un apagón afectó el barrio. — Yesterday a power outage affected the neighborhood. Primero los vecinos llamaron a la compañía eléctrica. — First the neighbors called the electric company. Luego organizaron luces para todos. — Then they organized lights for everyone. También llevaron comida a las personas mayores. — They also brought food to the elderly. El apagón terminó por la noche. — The outage ended at night.

7
00:01:22.689 --> 00:01:32.843
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
